&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Modular Reikland Line Infantry
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Reikland Line Infantry are the professional career soldiers form Reikland province of the Empire, they are volunteery and very well discipline unit. These soldiers are the main units that Reikland provides to the Empirium, other provinces can also request or hire them from the governing body of Reikland.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;In the regiment there are three ranks, Riflemen, NCO, Sergeant and ceremonial rank Drummer.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;My idea behind this is to modernized old Empire Hand Gunners, now they use armor and bolt action rifles. Company captains are now officers, Lords are now generals shooting their black powder revolvers instead of the flintlock pistols. Scale is very close to the old minis.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Hollowed and supported on chitubox for your printing convenience. Please enjoy and I&amp;#39;ll be happy for your feed back
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
